        "notes": "The main character in the game is depicted smoking a cigarette that grants superpowers. While the smoking is part of the character's abilities, it does not promote or endorse drug use or addiction. \r\n\r\nThe game explores historical events and their consequences. It includes references to European civilizations colonizing North America and violently repressing a rebellion. While the game does not depict the violence in a graphic or explicit manner, it may allude to the historical context and consequences of such actions.\r\n\r\nThe game may contain implied references to domestic violence against children within the storyline or dialogue. These references are not shown graphically, but their existence is implied. They are presented in a respectful manner and are intended to contribute to the narrative and character development."
